WEBVTT

00:00:11.790 --> 00:00:15.790
Today, the princess made a momentous decision.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.870
I want that, not a mere substitute.
I'll get one and sleep upon it.

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:27.490
"Special Quest"
"Get One at All Costs and Sleep upon It"

00:00:33.790 --> 00:00:39.120
But the problem is, I can only
acquire one in the Human Realm.

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:40.290
I have no choice...

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:46.620
Demon King! The princess is leaving
the Demon Castle again!

00:00:46.620 --> 00:00:48.160
Say what?!

00:02:19.120 --> 00:02:23.990
"Tenth Night"
"The Princess in Endopolis"

00:02:24.120 --> 00:02:27.290
What should I do?
Should I dispatch all to recapture her?

00:02:27.290 --> 00:02:32.540
It's okay, this happens all the time.
I'm sure she'll be back soon.

00:02:32.540 --> 00:02:35.290
Demon King! The non-perishable
foods have been stolen!

00:02:35.290 --> 00:02:36.130
What?!

00:02:36.150 --> 00:02:36.410
What?!

00:02:40.010 --> 00:02:42.260
Jerky

00:02:41.010 --> 00:02:42.260
All-out mode item 1

00:02:43.410 --> 00:02:46.370
Sh-She's still within
the grounds, though, right?

00:02:46.370 --> 00:02:48.990
She'll never get past the new fort--

00:02:48.990 --> 00:02:51.740
Demon King!
The explosives have also been stolen!

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:53.910
Fort

00:02:52.410 --> 00:02:53.910
All-out
mode item 2

00:02:56.040 --> 00:03:00.160
After each explosion,
I have three seconds before it collapses.

00:03:00.160 --> 00:03:02.830
She seems more determined than usual.

00:03:02.830 --> 00:03:03.870
She does.

00:03:03.870 --> 00:03:04.870
Yes.

00:03:04.870 --> 00:03:08.620
Wait, was she always this fast of a runner?

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:10.830
Perhaps it's easier to run in those clothes.

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:12.660
Can clothes make that drastic a change?!

00:03:12.660 --> 00:03:14.910
But what is her objective?

00:03:14.910 --> 00:03:18.290
Demon King! I found this in her cell!

00:03:18.290 --> 00:03:27.740
Off to visit the Human Realm.
Off to visit the Human Realm.

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:29.330
Off to visit--

00:03:29.330 --> 00:03:31.200
Do whatever it takes to recapture her!

00:03:33.490 --> 00:03:36.870
Th-The Human Realm?! Did it say Human Realm?!

00:03:36.870 --> 00:03:38.580
It <i>is</i> the time of year to return home.

00:03:38.580 --> 00:03:40.240
She's a damn hostage!

00:03:45.580 --> 00:03:48.990
All hands! Don't let the princess get past
the Forest of Sacred Treasure!

00:03:48.990 --> 00:03:51.410
A poison swamp lies ahead of it!

00:03:51.410 --> 00:03:54.910
Damn, that princess is such a pain!

00:03:54.910 --> 00:03:57.040
Projected coordinates... There!

00:03:58.330 --> 00:03:59.490
Give it up!

00:03:59.490 --> 00:04:00.490
Yes!

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:05.240
She got past him!

00:04:05.240 --> 00:04:08.200
How did she do it?! Does she play football?!

00:04:06.990 --> 00:04:08.200
Captive
princess

00:04:10.370 --> 00:04:13.740
Poseidon, do that move again!
Hello? Poseidon?!

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:16.620
Running past

00:04:16.870 --> 00:04:20.040
That warp move was pretty cool.

00:04:24.540 --> 00:04:27.790
Dammit! Dammit! What an idiot!

00:04:27.790 --> 00:04:29.950
He's taken damage somehow!

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:33.660
You're useless! Let me handle this!

00:04:34.710 --> 00:04:38.710
Potion stoppers attack

00:04:34.990 --> 00:04:36.370
Yeowch!

00:04:36.370 --> 00:04:38.910
Fire Venom Dragon!

00:04:38.910 --> 00:04:44.700
J-Just what is she?!
What are we up against, a ninja?!

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:49.850
Robbery

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:49.850
Escape

00:04:45.700 --> 00:04:47.540
She could be...

00:04:46.590 --> 00:04:49.850
Caltrops(?)

00:04:47.540 --> 00:04:49.830
She's a captive princess! Calm yourself, please!

00:04:49.990 --> 00:04:53.790
But if she goes any farther,
she'll encounter the poison swamp!

00:04:54.740 --> 00:04:57.370
Look, a flying pod!

00:04:57.370 --> 00:05:00.330
So she plans to evade it by flying.

00:05:00.330 --> 00:05:03.660
In her haste, the princess has chosen
a conspicuous mode of transport!

00:05:04.120 --> 00:05:05.660
To somewhere not here

00:05:05.790 --> 00:05:07.620
N-No, it's a decoy!

00:05:07.620 --> 00:05:09.290
Which way did she go, then?

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:14.620
Poison swamp

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:12.580
Jet skiing!

00:05:12.580 --> 00:05:14.620
Scissors

00:05:12.580 --> 00:05:13.330
Jet skiing!

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:14.620
Shield of Wind's power source

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:14.620
Jet skiing!

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:19.960
"Dominating the field!!!"

00:05:17.240 --> 00:05:19.450
She's completely dominating the field!

00:05:21.740 --> 00:05:23.080
Demon King?

00:05:23.990 --> 00:05:28.240
That's it! I'm going down there to set a trap!

00:05:28.240 --> 00:05:30.040
What? You have one?

00:05:30.040 --> 00:05:32.580
I'm setting it at the far side of the swamp!

00:05:32.580 --> 00:05:33.990
You sound a little desperate.

00:05:38.490 --> 00:05:39.990
Bed trap

00:05:40.200 --> 00:05:42.370
Wait, hang on.

00:05:42.370 --> 00:05:45.200
She'll never fall for that.

00:05:57.040 --> 00:05:58.540
She a wild animal?

00:06:00.330 --> 00:06:03.990
Y-You wanted to purchase sleep products?!

00:06:03.990 --> 00:06:05.160
Yeah.

00:06:05.160 --> 00:06:08.200
Human's Shopping Channel!

00:06:08.200 --> 00:06:10.620
Here's the product of the day!

00:06:10.620 --> 00:06:15.660
I present the R&R Massage Pillow,
a top seller in the Human Realm!

00:06:15.660 --> 00:06:21.660
Free of magic, get the best sleep of your life
using only the power of human science!

00:06:21.660 --> 00:06:26.830
Nanomachines within deliver low-frequency
vibrations. High tech and ubiquitous!

00:06:26.830 --> 00:06:32.120
These have sold so fast,
you'll find three in every household!

00:06:32.120 --> 00:06:34.990
I planned to bring back souvenirs for you.

00:06:34.990 --> 00:06:36.950
That's not the issue!

00:06:36.950 --> 00:06:41.330
Sheesh... Listen, you're a <i>hostage</i> !

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:44.870
You may have thought to go
on a quick shopping trip,

00:06:44.870 --> 00:06:47.660
but the nearest human town is miles away!

00:06:47.660 --> 00:06:49.410
Is that what you were worried about?

00:06:51.290 --> 00:06:56.950
Plus, if a human saw you out there alone,
they would've taken you back home.

00:06:56.950 --> 00:06:59.330
As the demon king, I cannot allow that!

00:06:59.330 --> 00:07:01.330
So, don't do this--

00:07:01.330 --> 00:07:05.450
Then... Then, come with me to the Human Realm.

00:07:10.580 --> 00:07:11.740
Huh?

00:07:11.740 --> 00:07:14.240
Nuh-uh! No way! What are you saying?!

00:07:14.240 --> 00:07:16.910
One jump for you and you're there, right?

00:07:16.910 --> 00:07:19.990
I won't try to go by myself if you accompany me.

00:07:19.990 --> 00:07:24.540
B-But if people find out we're
demons in a human town...

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:27.740
Besides, humans and demons despise each other.

00:07:34.910 --> 00:07:36.700
It would probably be fine.

00:07:36.700 --> 00:07:38.700
How can you be so heedless?

00:07:38.700 --> 00:07:41.870
Because I know you're all kind and good people.

00:07:49.450 --> 00:07:52.620
Um, I-I suppose if we
treat it as an inspection...

00:07:52.620 --> 00:07:53.580
What?!

00:07:53.580 --> 00:07:57.080
But Demon King! W-Wouldn't it be
more prudent to think it through?!

00:07:57.080 --> 00:08:01.370
It's set, then. Make it tomorrow.
Don't want it to be sold out. Good night.

00:08:01.370 --> 00:08:02.370
What?!

00:08:03.830 --> 00:08:07.590
"Quest Continues"

00:08:08.040 --> 00:08:09.540
Tomorrow?!

00:08:11.240 --> 00:08:17.330
We're going on an outing tomorrow, huh?
That might make it hard to fall asleep.

00:08:18.490 --> 00:08:22.910
But trying to sleep in the excitement
the night before an outing

00:08:22.910 --> 00:08:25.620
is part of the experience.

00:08:27.200 --> 00:08:28.580
Zzz...

00:08:33.620 --> 00:08:37.120
H-Hey, what should I do? I can't sleep.

00:08:36.490 --> 00:08:42.160
Rarely visits human towns

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:39.290
I-It'll be my first time.

00:08:38.740 --> 00:08:42.160
Never leaves the Demon Castle

00:08:39.290 --> 00:08:41.910
How much do we need to disguise ourselves?

00:08:41.910 --> 00:08:44.490
Probably just our horns and tails?

00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:42.200
Rarely visits human towns

00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:42.200
Never leaves the Demon Castle

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:42.250
Rarely visits human towns

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:42.250
Never leaves the Demon Castle

00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:42.290
Rarely visits human towns

00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:42.290
Never leaves the Demon Castle

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:42.330
Rarely visits human towns

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:42.330
Never leaves the Demon Castle

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:42.370
Never leaves the Demon Castle

00:08:42.370 --> 00:08:42.410
Never leaves the Demon Castle

00:08:42.410 --> 00:08:42.450
Never leaves the Demon Castle

00:08:42.450 --> 00:08:42.500
Never leaves the Demon Castle

00:08:44.490 --> 00:08:46.290
Perhaps I should shave my fur...

00:08:46.290 --> 00:08:47.200
Not that.

00:08:47.200 --> 00:08:53.910
Th-The Human Realm?
My blue skin means I'm staying behind.

00:08:53.910 --> 00:08:58.450
But why the heck is that dog so keen on going?

00:08:54.790 --> 00:08:55.870
Not your fur.

00:08:59.010 --> 00:09:04.020
Fire Venom Dragon

00:09:00.120 --> 00:09:01.830
<i>Sleepy Princess in the Demon Castle</i> !

00:09:04.830 --> 00:09:05.990
We're here.

00:09:12.950 --> 00:09:16.540
Endopolis, the nearest city to the Demon Castle.

00:09:16.540 --> 00:09:18.040
Endopolis

00:09:18.660 --> 00:09:24.080
The princess has her disguise,
and I've got the perfect one myself!

00:09:20.540 --> 00:09:22.040
Traveler look

00:09:23.660 --> 00:09:25.160
Horns

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:25.290
Huh?

00:09:25.290 --> 00:09:27.040
That's right!

00:09:26.210 --> 00:09:28.170
Ears

00:09:26.210 --> 00:09:28.170
Tail

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:28.370
Uh...

00:09:28.370 --> 00:09:31.240
Covering my whole body works sufficiently.

00:09:31.240 --> 00:09:32.660
Huh?!

00:09:34.870 --> 00:09:36.160
Wh-What was that for?!

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:42.240
Practicing for Halloween

00:09:38.790 --> 00:09:42.240
Ah, so it's for Halloween!

00:09:42.700 --> 00:09:43.620
We're going in!

00:09:43.620 --> 00:09:45.740
Disguises

00:09:43.720 --> 00:09:45.740
Bam

00:10:02.330 --> 00:10:05.990
Princess, we've only come to survey the area.

00:10:05.990 --> 00:10:09.450
We're going back immediately
after you get your item.

00:10:09.450 --> 00:10:13.290
I know. Thanks for letting me drag you along.

00:10:13.290 --> 00:10:16.540
I understand the position I'm in.

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:18.630
Hostage

00:10:16.540 --> 00:10:18.660
Her words and actions don't match up!

00:10:18.740 --> 00:10:22.080
What? When did you get that?
What's that? Popcorn?!

00:10:22.080 --> 00:10:27.410
This one's salted butter, this one's caramel,
and this one's banana milk tea flavored.

00:10:27.410 --> 00:10:28.660
Is this a theme park?!

00:10:28.660 --> 00:10:30.160
Wait, how'd you pay for them?

00:10:30.160 --> 00:10:35.950
I popped open a couple
of treasure boxes recently...

00:10:35.950 --> 00:10:38.200
You can't just take the contents!

00:10:38.200 --> 00:10:42.240
I got some for you all, too. Here.

00:10:42.240 --> 00:10:43.540
Wh-What's this?

00:10:46.870 --> 00:10:48.660
These are delightful!

00:10:48.660 --> 00:10:50.870
What are these called?

00:10:50.870 --> 00:10:55.040
Endopolis' famed confections,
Kill Those Demons Sweet Buns.

00:10:55.040 --> 00:10:57.040
Skewered Demon Dumplings included.

00:11:00.450 --> 00:11:02.330
Want to buy extra to take back as souvenirs?

00:11:02.330 --> 00:11:06.200
No thanks! Curse those humans!

00:11:06.200 --> 00:11:07.200
Delicious.

00:11:12.370 --> 00:11:16.540
Did this dog really think this
disguise would fool anybody?

00:11:27.240 --> 00:11:29.240
Let it go since he's cute

00:11:29.540 --> 00:11:33.160
A-Anyway, quickly get your item
so we can return home.

00:11:33.160 --> 00:11:36.080
What was it again? The R&R Massage Pillow?

00:11:36.080 --> 00:11:40.990
Get the latest R&R Massage Pillow DX!

00:11:40.990 --> 00:11:46.040
The new and improved version of
the top-selling R&R Massage Pillow!

00:11:46.040 --> 00:11:48.660
Massage power now lasts twice as long!

00:11:48.660 --> 00:11:53.830
Five speed settings and a timer
for an even better sleep!

00:11:53.830 --> 00:11:56.580
Exclusive pre-sale here!

00:12:05.410 --> 00:12:06.410
That one.

00:12:06.410 --> 00:12:08.620
Why did they announce that now?!

00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:12.240
What? Didn't you want the R&R Massage Pillow?

00:12:12.240 --> 00:12:13.790
Many other shops sell that one--

00:12:13.790 --> 00:12:15.290
I want the deluxe version.

00:12:15.290 --> 00:12:17.790
There's no convincing her!

00:12:17.790 --> 00:12:19.910
Wh-What now?

00:12:19.910 --> 00:12:25.160
Fine! The princess will escape again
unless she gets the deluxe version!

00:12:25.160 --> 00:12:27.580
The current wait is three hours.

00:12:25.390 --> 00:12:28.010
Numbered ticket

00:12:28.660 --> 00:12:33.040
Oh, man. We might not get
back to the castle today.

00:12:33.040 --> 00:12:34.120
It's too bad.

00:12:34.120 --> 00:12:36.450
Princess, don't pull the ears!

00:12:36.900 --> 00:12:38.900
One
hour
later

00:12:37.490 --> 00:12:39.950
Princess, do you have money?

00:12:39.950 --> 00:12:41.080
Yeah.

00:12:41.080 --> 00:12:42.080
I see.

00:12:42.400 --> 00:12:44.400
Two
hours
later

00:12:43.160 --> 00:12:46.490
C-Cursed fetters.

00:12:46.490 --> 00:12:48.450
Saintly grain.

00:12:48.450 --> 00:12:50.450
Neo Alraune?

00:12:50.450 --> 00:12:51.490
Extra pjs.

00:12:51.790 --> 00:12:53.790
Three
hours
later

00:12:53.200 --> 00:12:56.240
Hm? Demon King, you're getting farther away.

00:12:56.240 --> 00:12:57.540
Really?

00:12:57.290 --> 00:12:59.290
Four
hours
later

00:12:57.540 --> 00:13:01.870
Look how far away he is now. Why would that happen?

00:13:01.870 --> 00:13:02.910
Huh?

00:13:05.740 --> 00:13:09.950
R&R Massage Pillow DX

00:13:06.740 --> 00:13:09.950
Fireworks VIP Seat Lottery

00:13:10.120 --> 00:13:13.370
I stood in the wrong line!

00:13:13.370 --> 00:13:15.160
What are you doing?!

00:13:15.160 --> 00:13:18.790
There's no point in lining up again
over there, so I'll stay here.

00:13:18.790 --> 00:13:22.120
I won't be there to help,
but make sure to buy it!

00:13:21.900 --> 00:13:26.410
Human Realm novices

00:13:22.120 --> 00:13:23.700
R-Right...

00:13:23.700 --> 00:13:26.580
And Princess! You're almost up! You ready?

00:13:26.410 --> 00:13:29.910
Tired

00:13:26.580 --> 00:13:28.790
Uh-huh...

00:13:28.790 --> 00:13:30.200
I'm worried.

00:13:30.200 --> 00:13:33.120
P-Princess, don't you want your sleep item?

00:13:33.120 --> 00:13:34.490
Yeah...

00:13:34.490 --> 00:13:36.790
Aren't you buying it yourself? You up for it?

00:13:36.790 --> 00:13:38.080
Yup...

00:13:38.080 --> 00:13:44.620
The smells here are so nostalgic, you see.
It smells of the Human Realm.

00:13:44.620 --> 00:13:48.120
Remember what you're here to do!

00:13:48.120 --> 00:13:53.160
R-Remember that we're not as accustomed
to the Human Realm as the demon king.

00:13:53.160 --> 00:13:55.870
We may not be capable of making
the purchase! That okay?!

00:13:58.200 --> 00:13:59.230
That won't do.

00:13:59.230 --> 00:14:00.120
Right?

00:14:00.120 --> 00:14:01.200
Next customer!

00:14:01.200 --> 00:14:03.160
Oh, it's our turn.

00:14:03.160 --> 00:14:04.290
That took forever.

00:14:04.290 --> 00:14:05.950
You can say that again.

00:14:05.950 --> 00:14:08.040
That'll be 3,000 gold!

00:14:08.040 --> 00:14:09.540
So expensive!

00:14:09.540 --> 00:14:12.700
Princess, come on, get your money out.

00:14:12.700 --> 00:14:14.700
That'll be 3,000 gold!

00:14:18.450 --> 00:14:22.490
P-Princess? It's 3,000 gold... Princess?

00:14:22.490 --> 00:14:25.490
Hey, you can sleep on it afterwards, right? Hey!

00:14:27.660 --> 00:14:29.330
Zzz...

00:14:29.330 --> 00:14:30.910
She really is asleep!

00:14:33.950 --> 00:14:36.830
What to do? I can't just rummage for her wallet.

00:14:36.830 --> 00:14:38.870
And I only have 1,000 gold...

00:14:38.870 --> 00:14:40.910
That'll be 3,000 gold!

00:14:40.910 --> 00:14:45.330
I-I'll go ask the demon k--
our <i>friend</i> to lend us some.

00:14:45.330 --> 00:14:46.330
Right...

00:14:46.330 --> 00:14:48.200
That'll be 3,000 gold!

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:51.620
I'm sorry. I'm really sorry about this!
He'll be right back!

00:14:51.620 --> 00:14:53.160
That'll be 3,000 gold!

00:14:55.870 --> 00:15:00.450
We somehow purchased it.
I wasn't sure for a moment there.

00:15:00.450 --> 00:15:05.790
Man, this princess... I'm pretty spent,
so I'll need to rest at that inn

00:15:05.790 --> 00:15:09.040
before performing the long-distance
transportation spell--

00:15:08.470 --> 00:15:10.840
1,000g per night per person

00:15:09.040 --> 00:15:11.120
1,000 gold per person?!

00:15:11.120 --> 00:15:12.200
So expensive!

00:15:11.720 --> 00:15:12.970
Five
times
the
regular
rate

00:15:13.450 --> 00:15:15.410
I don't... have enough.

00:15:17.700 --> 00:15:19.120
Zzz...

00:15:20.980 --> 00:15:25.980
Bianco & Florence

00:15:21.990 --> 00:15:23.700
<i>Sleepy Princess in the Demon Castle</i> !

00:15:27.040 --> 00:15:31.790
This means... we'll have to return to
a place where there are fewer people,

00:15:31.790 --> 00:15:34.580
and warp back after we rest a bit.

00:15:34.580 --> 00:15:35.740
I understand.

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:39.290
But Demon King, the crowd is thickening...

00:15:39.290 --> 00:15:41.450
Wh-What's this huge crowd doing here?!

00:15:46.620 --> 00:15:47.170
Uh...

00:15:47.170 --> 00:15:48.200
Wha--?

00:15:48.200 --> 00:15:49.200
Hm?

00:15:57.080 --> 00:16:01.620
Right, it's the fireworks display!
Didn't you get a lottery ticket for it?

00:16:01.620 --> 00:16:02.620
Oh, yeah!

00:16:07.660 --> 00:16:10.620
What now? There are more people
than during the day now.

00:16:10.620 --> 00:16:14.580
We'll have to force our way through
to a more abandoned area.

00:16:14.580 --> 00:16:15.870
I understand.

00:16:15.870 --> 00:16:16.830
Hey.

00:16:16.830 --> 00:16:17.740
Huh? What is it?

00:16:20.330 --> 00:16:24.120
Those are "kill the demon" symbols.

00:16:24.120 --> 00:16:26.410
We don't have time for that right now!

00:16:26.410 --> 00:16:28.080
We've got to hurry and warp--

00:16:28.080 --> 00:16:28.800
Hey.

00:16:28.800 --> 00:16:29.740
Now what?

00:16:30.050 --> 00:16:32.050
Lottery for Fireworks Display VIP Seats

00:16:32.330 --> 00:16:35.660
Your lottery ticket was chosen.

00:16:35.660 --> 00:16:36.660
Huh?

00:16:37.300 --> 00:16:38.330
Winner

00:16:38.540 --> 00:16:39.620
Huh?

00:16:39.620 --> 00:16:41.540
Huh? Huh?

00:16:41.540 --> 00:16:43.490
What?!

00:16:43.490 --> 00:16:45.040
Enjoy your time.

00:16:45.040 --> 00:16:48.080
P-Princess, we must make haste--

00:16:48.080 --> 00:16:51.120
Now, now. Now, now.

00:16:51.120 --> 00:16:53.830
Whoa, these really are prime seats.

00:16:53.830 --> 00:16:55.790
Now, now. Here you go.

00:16:55.790 --> 00:16:57.240
Th-Thanks.

00:16:57.240 --> 00:17:00.120
Go on now. Here.

00:17:00.120 --> 00:17:01.580
One drink won't hurt.

00:17:11.040 --> 00:17:14.120
Hang on a second!
Now's not the time to be enjoying this!

00:17:14.120 --> 00:17:16.790
Seriously, why are you stalling us--

00:17:26.080 --> 00:17:31.540
How beautiful will it be to dream
beneath these bursting fireworks?

00:17:31.540 --> 00:17:33.870
So this was your goal?!

00:17:33.870 --> 00:17:35.200
Zzz...

00:17:42.490 --> 00:17:43.870
Zzz...

00:17:52.490 --> 00:17:53.830
Zzz...

00:17:56.950 --> 00:17:58.540
I can't sleep!

00:17:58.540 --> 00:18:00.330
Of course you can't, Princess!

00:18:00.330 --> 00:18:01.830
She has such terrible foresight!

00:18:08.740 --> 00:18:12.120
All in all, they are quite lovely.

00:18:12.120 --> 00:18:13.330
Yeah.

00:18:13.330 --> 00:18:17.080
And they have some <i>unique</i> symbols.

00:18:17.080 --> 00:18:18.120
They do.

00:18:18.490 --> 00:18:20.120
Slaughtered demon symbol

00:18:20.490 --> 00:18:22.120
Squashed demon symbol

00:18:22.490 --> 00:18:24.120
Destroy the demons symbol

00:18:29.740 --> 00:18:33.370
You could make a "minced human" symbol.

00:18:33.370 --> 00:18:35.870
Aren't you a <i>human</i> princess?!

00:18:35.870 --> 00:18:36.910
So, no?

00:18:38.330 --> 00:18:42.290
But... even if we did,
the conflict wouldn't end.

00:18:45.240 --> 00:18:50.700
Humans say that the world was peaceful
until the demons retaliated.

00:18:50.700 --> 00:18:52.990
But that's only because we were holding back

00:18:52.990 --> 00:18:56.910
after most of us were forced
to live in the underworld.

00:18:56.910 --> 00:19:02.290
Whatever the outcome,
a representative from the demons and humans

00:19:02.290 --> 00:19:05.200
must fight face-on to settle
the matter once and for all.

00:19:05.200 --> 00:19:08.700
Otherwise, strife will reemerge.

00:19:08.700 --> 00:19:10.290
That's the reason why we...

00:19:17.910 --> 00:19:18.950
Princess?

00:19:36.200 --> 00:19:40.330
That's right. We're enemies.

00:19:40.330 --> 00:19:44.540
The princess was finally able
to come back to her own realm.

00:19:44.540 --> 00:19:48.910
She must have been stalling earlier,
because she didn't want to go back.

00:19:50.990 --> 00:19:53.240
Grinning demons symbol --Sya

00:19:54.950 --> 00:19:57.330
What's this?

00:19:57.330 --> 00:19:58.990
Heh guh hoo.

00:19:58.990 --> 00:20:00.120
What'd you say?!

00:20:04.200 --> 00:20:05.700
Let's go home.

00:20:05.700 --> 00:20:06.830
She repeated herself.

00:20:13.370 --> 00:20:15.160
We can finally return.

00:20:14.900 --> 00:20:17.650
Strained back trying
to carry the princess.

00:20:15.160 --> 00:20:18.870
These all count as summer memories.

00:20:18.870 --> 00:20:22.830
And she fell asleep the moment
the fireworks ended.

00:20:22.830 --> 00:20:26.370
What a strange sight.
It's for the sake of travel,

00:20:26.370 --> 00:20:30.450
but to see this demon boss carrying
his sleeping captive princess on his back...

00:20:32.290 --> 00:20:34.700
This... T-Turn it off!

00:20:35.870 --> 00:20:37.450
Zzz...

00:20:40.170 --> 00:20:48.680
Quest Complete

00:20:45.410 --> 00:20:48.290
Excellent! Great job!

00:20:49.040 --> 00:20:51.410
Where's... the switch...

00:20:51.410 --> 00:20:53.160
Right, let's go home.

00:20:53.160 --> 00:20:55.950
Huh? What was that?

00:20:55.950 --> 00:20:57.160
Hands together!

00:21:09.490 --> 00:21:13.450
Next
day

00:21:13.740 --> 00:21:14.740
Princess.

00:21:15.830 --> 00:21:19.160
What of the R&R Massage Pillow DX?

00:21:19.160 --> 00:21:22.540
You see, the Teddy Demons love it.

00:21:27.740 --> 00:21:32.240
Teddy Demons lined
up for multiple days

00:21:28.990 --> 00:21:32.240
We worked pretty hard to get that, you know!

00:21:32.620 --> 00:21:35.700
Thank you for the souvenirs, Princess.

00:21:35.700 --> 00:21:37.330
Those Kill Demon Buns tasted great.

00:21:39.290 --> 00:21:42.830
Did you enjoy your time at that, um, Humanland?

00:21:42.830 --> 00:21:43.830
Yup.

00:21:43.830 --> 00:21:45.580
She thinks it's a theme park.

00:23:25.450 --> 00:23:27.080
Humanland, huh?

00:23:42.870 --> 00:23:45.660
They say that lack of exercise
causes sleep problems.

00:23:45.660 --> 00:23:49.870
But I will sleep well tonight,
and it's all thanks to the princess.

00:23:49.870 --> 00:23:52.240
Wait, maybe it's not.

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:54.870
Next time, "The Princess and Troubling Dreams."

00:23:54.870 --> 00:23:56.160
<i>Sleepy Princess in the Demon Castle</i> .
